I think {ki} is a ((Cmavo that are a ghastly waste of precious monosyllabic cmavo space|ghastly waste of precious monosyllabic cmavo space)), and I propose that it be deprecated in favor of a longer synonym {ki'i'o} (derived from {ki} and {ni'o}).

If we deprecate {ki} now, then maybe we can start using it for something really useful and cool in a few years.

— Daniel Brockman